# NEXUS BANKING customer client - connection notes (the app stores its last used addresses automatically).
# On the login screen, open "Kết nối nâng cao" and enter:
#   Chi nhánh A (Hà Nội)  : <IP of laptop running Node A>:1099
#   Chi nhánh B (TP.HCM)  : <IP of laptop running Node B>:1099
# Live balance push uses an RMI callback: the BRANCH connects back to the client, so the client laptop must accept
# inbound TCP connections (allow Java through the firewall) and be on the same LAN. If it cannot, the app falls back to
# polling every 2 seconds and shows "Polling" instead of "Realtime (RMI callback)".
# JVM options (optional): -Dnexus.client.callback.host=<this laptop LAN IP>   -Dnexus.client.ssl=true
